<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:02.400">Here are some words that begin<br />with the &quot;cuh&quot; sound</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.400" end="00:00:03.867">in the letter &quot;c.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.867" end="00:00:05.467">Cookie.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.467" end="00:00:06.467">Cool.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.467" end="00:00:08.067">Collar.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.067" end="00:00:09.933">Catcher.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.933" end="00:00:12.033">Carrot.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.033" end="00:00:13.133">Corn.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:13.133" end="00:00:14.600">Cornflakes.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.600" end="00:00:15.867">&quot;C.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:15.867" end="00:00:17.267">(makes hard &quot;c&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
